    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Looking for a tool to showcase your custom logos effortlessly? &#8220;Elite Logo Showcase – Display Logos in a Slider, Carousel, or Grid&#8221; lets you easily display your selected logos in a slider, carousel, or grid format. It offers customization options.</p>\n<p>Set up your WordPress logo display with responsive layouts for slider, carousel, and grid using a guternberg block, and showcase your logos in just a few clicks.</p>\n<p><strong>GUTENBERG BLOCK</strong></p>\n<p>The launch of the Elite Logo Showcase Gutenberg Block empowers the WordPress Gutenberg editor with the ability to create stunning logo displays in multiple layouts, including grids, carousels, and sliders. With a variety of themes, this tool enhances brand visibility in the most effective way.</p>\n<p>All the essential features for designing fully responsive and seamless logo sliders, grids, and carousels are already built into your workflow, allowing you to effortlessly showcase brands, partners, and sponsors with ease. 🚀</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>This section describes how to install the plugin and get it working.</p>\n<p>e.g.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/elite-logo-showcase</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20the%20plugin%3F'>\nCan I customize the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Yes, you can customize the from the plugin settings.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20the%20plugin%20mobile-friendly%3F'>\nIs the plugin mobile-friendly?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Absolutely! The plugin is optimized for mobile devices to provide a superior shopping experience on any device.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='will%20the%20plugin%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nWill the plugin work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Absolutely! Our plugin is designed to be fully compatible with any WordPress theme. Whether you&#8217;re using a free theme or a premium one, the plugin seamlessly integrates with your site’s design, maintaining a consistent look and feel while adding powerful new features.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20the%20plugin%20easy%20to%20set%20up%20and%20use%3F'>\nIs the plugin easy to set up and use?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Absolutely! Our plugin is designed for a quick and straightforward setup. With a user-friendly interface and step-by-step guidance, you can configure all the features in just a few minutes, even if you have no technical background. Start enhancing your WooCommerce store effortlessly, right out of the box.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Css Issue Fixed</li>\n<li>Category Added</li>\n<li>Performance optimized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Elite Logo Showcase",
    "description": "<p>Looking for a tool to showcase your custom logos effortlessly? &#8220;Elite Logo Showcase – Display Logos in a Slider, Carousel, or Grid&#8221; lets you easily display your selected logos in a slider, carousel, or grid format. It offers customization options.</p>\n<p>Set up your WordPress logo display with responsive layouts for slider, carousel, and grid using a guternberg block, and showcase your logos in just a few clicks.</p>\n<p><strong>GUTENBERG BLOCK</strong></p>\n<p>The launch of the Elite Logo Showcase Gutenberg Block empowers the WordPress Gutenberg editor with the ability to create stunning logo displays in multiple layouts, including grids, carousels, and sliders. With a variety of themes, this tool enhances brand visibility in the most effective way.</p>\n<p>All the essential features for designing fully responsive and seamless logo sliders, grids, and carousels are already built into your workflow, allowing you to effortlessly showcase brands, partners, and sponsors with ease. 🚀</p>\n",
